    "groundingSupports": [
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 29,
       "endIndex": 137,
       "text": "**The overall grant size is solid, but the initial package has gaps that make it premature to accept as-is**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 142,
       "endIndex": 368,
       "text": "**Total Comp & Vesting Math:** Google\u2019s initial equity grants typically follow a front-loaded vesting schedule (typically **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** or **38% / 32% / 20% / 10%** over 4 years, rather than an even 25% per year)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 525,
       "endIndex": 629,
       "text": "If on the **38/32/20/10** schedule, your Year 1 equity is **~$410k**, making Year 1 TC roughly **$692k**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 813,
       "endIndex": 952,
       "text": "**The Year 3\u20134 Equity Cliff:** Because Google front-loads new-hire grants, by Year 4 your initial grant equity drops to ~$108k\u2013$130k/yr"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1068,
       "endIndex": 1205,
       "text": "**No Sign-On Bonus:** Google frequently uses sign-on bonuses to bridge unvested equity and performance bonus timing when hiring from Meta"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1207,
       "endIndex": 1309,
       "text": "Leaving $200k+ in unvested Meta RSUs and walking into a $0 sign-on bonus is leaving money on the table"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1500,
       "endIndex": 1599,
       "text": "You are already at **Meta IC6**, a peer level with high internal visibility and strong compensation"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1603,
       "endIndex": 1755,
       "text": "Google\u2019s compensation bands for L6 PM have headroom to adjust both base and equity, and sign-on bonuses are routinely approved for lateral FAANG moves"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1811,
       "endIndex": 1896,
       "text": "Present a structured counter that targets the upper quartile of Google\u2019s L6 PM band"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2140,
       "endIndex": 2292,
       "text": "| **Sign-On Bonus** | $0 | **$75,000 \u2013 $100,000** | Offsets unvested Meta RSUs vesting over the next 12 months and forfeiting your upcoming Meta bonus"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2296,
       "endIndex": 2470,
       "text": "| **Equity (4-yr GSU)**| $1,080,000 | **$1,250,000 \u2013 $1,300,000** | Protects total compensation against the Year 3\u20134 front-loading cliff and matches top-of-band L6 offers"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2522,
       "endIndex": 2720,
       "text": "When speaking with your Google recruiter, frame the negotiation around your enthusiasm for the scope while maintaining that the transition must make clear financial sense given your standing at Meta"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2747,
       "endIndex": 2872,
       "text": "*\"I\u2019ve really enjoyed getting to know the team and the problem space, and I can see myself making a big impact in this role"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2874,
       "endIndex": 3005,
       "text": "However, as you know, I wasn\u2019t actively looking to leave Meta, where I\u2019m well-supported and on a strong compensation trajectory"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3161,
       "endIndex": 3251,
       "text": "*Leaving Meta means leaving substantial unvested equity and our upcoming performance cycle"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3258,
       "endIndex": 3452,
       "text": "*If we can get the base salary to **$255,000**, include a **$80,000 sign-on bonus** to bridge the transition, and increase the equity grant to **$1.25M**, I would be thrilled to sign immediately"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3494,
       "endIndex": 3684,
       "text": "**If they meet your terms (or close, e.g., $250k base + $75k sign-on + $1.2M equity):** **Accept**, as this guarantees significant Year 1\u20132 upside over Meta while protecting your cash flow"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3750,
       "endIndex": 3885,
       "text": "** Given that you are happy, taking a base cut without a sign-on buffer to absorb unvested Meta stock creates unnecessary downside risk"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
